`),w2={"roles-lineups":{about:"Your lineups and the shipped ones; the active one is marked.",help:Yl("Click a lineup to open it on the canvas.","New and Duplicate make your own copy; Delete asks first (shipped ones stay).","Apply makes the open lineup the one new sessions use (it asks first).","user / project: where New, Save and Delete write.")},"roles-graph":{about:"The open lineup as cards, one box per tier: who plays each part, on which model.",help:Yl("Drag a card into another tier box to move it there (the lineup saves); main stays in tier 0.","Drag a bio from Bios onto the canvas to add it.","A tier's label strip collapses or expands it. While a session runs, the cards whose agents work glow: hover a card's glyph or badge for what its glow means and when it goes.","Click the canvas, then A lays out, F fits, + / - zoom, the arrows nudge the selected card, Delete removes it.","Ctrl+Z undoes an edit, Ctrl+Shift+Z redoes it, Mod+S saves.")},"roles-inspector":{about:"The selected card's slot, every section of the lineup, and what runs on the card now.",help:Yl("Assignment: the bio, role, alias, instances, routing words and a model override.","Lineup: delegation, routing, budget, escalation, context, permissions, pipeline, acceptance, tiers.","Each section is a small form; YAML edits the raw section instead.","Live: the streams of the agents on the card, Steer, Pause, Stop, Pin; or its last runs, with replay.","MODEL, on top: what the card runs on and the select that changes it (a card's model pill jumps here).")},"roles-problems":{about:"What is wrong with the lineup as you edit it, each with its fix.",help:Yl("Blocks: Save answers 422 for these, or a run start stops on them (a dead model id, a bio with no tool).","Warns: worth a look (an alias in no tier, a fallback on the same gateway).","It re-reads after every edit, saved or not.","Click a row to select its card.")},"roles-bios":{about:"The agent bios: who each card is, on which model, with which tools.",help:Yl("Click a bio to edit it below; drag one onto the canvas to add it to the lineup.","MODELS comes first: the model select; more... unfolds the table (name, price, context, best at: the kinds and one line).","Learned chips (code 4/5) say how a model did at each task kind here; learned for <kind> strikes the ones dropped for it.","Test this model sends one short request and shows ok and the time, or the error.","Save writes your copy (a shipped bio stays as it is); New, Duplicate, Delete.")},"roles-models":{about:"The model catalog the pickers read: per provider, and why it is empty when it is.",help:Yl("Refresh asks every provider at once, a few seconds each, and shows what each said and when.","A provider with a key but not enabled says so: halo providers enable <name>.","Analyze rebuilds what each model is good at (halo models analyze): how many per kind, each kind's strongest.","Test a model by its ref, catalog or not.")}},Fl=(...e)=>e.join(`
`),k2={"session-live":{about:"Every agent here at once, live: what it types, each tool call and its result, what it hands back, what it asks you.",help:Fl("Lines land in the order they happen, in Fleet's columns: the time, the kind (TOOL, TEXT, STATE, ASK, YOU...) and the agent's tag (its colour, its name and its state: cyan works, amber waits, green done, red failed).","A tool call is one row: runs Bash, what it runs on, the time ticking while it runs, then the first line of its result; click the row for the whole result.","On top, the timeline: a lane per live agent of this session over 5, 15 or 60 minutes; click a lane to show only that agent. The agent and kind picks beside Follow narrow the lines.","Steer is always at the bottom: it talks to the agent you pinned, else the session's main agent, with Pause and Stop beside it. Hover a tag or a map node and click steer: that agent, the box ready to type.","Click a tag: only that agent; the tag again (or Esc) shows everyone. Follow keeps the newest line in view; scroll up and it pauses, ↓ N new brings you back. Hover a line: its node lights on the map.","An ask lands as an amber card with its A / R / S / O answers; the newest 500 lines stay here, the full log is in Activity.")},"session-map":{about:"Your sessions on this machine, each one's agents as a tree: who spawned whom, the model, the cost, the tool running now.",help:Fl("Each agent sits under the one that spawned it; a node shows its model, what it costs and, while a tool runs, its name and time (Bash 12s).","A cyan pulse works, amber waits on you, green just finished (it fades), red failed (it stays); the edge to it glows the same.","Click an agent to select it (its session becomes the chosen one); double-click opens Agent expanded; hover it and click steer to steer it from Live; the ... menu has Steer, Pause, Stop, Take over, Hand to, Record.","J / K hop between this harness's live agents; Fleet (Alt+4) still shows every harness.")},"session-agent":{about:"The selected agent: what it thinks, what it runs, what it hands back; steer it.",help:Fl("A strip until you open it (double-click an agent on the map opens it too).","Thinking is its text as it types it, Working one row per tool call, Output its hand-back.","Steer: a nudge it reads before its next step, or redirect to give it a new task. Pause holds it at its next step; Stop asks first (K here does the same).","F follows, Space pins a mini stream that stays on screen in every section.")},"session-activity":{about:"What the chosen session does: a timeline lane per live agent over its full live log.",help:Fl("Each lane shows an agent's states over 5, 15 or 60 minutes; the ticks are its tool calls.","The session pick switches between the chosen session and every session on this harness.","Filter by agent or kind; Follow keeps the newest line in view; click a line to select that agent.")},"session-attention":{about:"What waits on you in this harness's sessions, oldest first, one key each.",help:Fl("Cards (permission, question, plan, approval), gates, paused agents and spend caps of this harness; each also lands in Live as it arrives.","A accepts or allows, R denies or redoes with your text, S stops, O opens the panel it belongs to.","J / K (or the arrows) move between rows while this panel has the focus.")},"session-cost":{about:"What the chosen session has cost: the spend and how it rose, the context filling, cost per turn, each agent's share.",help:Fl("The spend, the tokens, the turns and the context move the moment the terminal's status bar does: at the end of each model call and at each turn's start and end.","The sparkline beside the spend is the spend since this page opened; the context bar is how full the model's context is: amber past 80 %, red past 95 %.","Turns are your turns in the session, as the terminal counts them; per turn is the spend over them. An agent's own model calls show as calls on its line.","The stacked bar is each agent's own share, its tokens in and out beside it: a finished sub-agent counts once, on its own line (main's share is the total less its finished sub-agents'); a running sub-agent's spend joins the total when it finishes.","Choose another session on the map (or in Activity's session pick) and Cost follows it.")}},$p=(...e)=>e.join(`
`),N2={"team-board":{about:"The team as one board: members as columns, stages as boxes, blocks underneath.",help:$p("Each column is a member (its lineup and role, the harness it runs on); a stage sits in the columns of its members.","A stage's colour is its state: grey pending, cyan outline ready, a cyan pulse running, amber at its gate, green done, red failed, dim skipped.","Edges: stage_done triggers down the right (lit once the stage they wait on is done), reads dashed and writes solid to the blocks, block_change from a block to its stage.","A block's badge counts who holds a part of it (amber while someone writes); its last change is under it.","Run next starts the next manual stage; Stop asks for a reason; Validate lists the file's problems and the preflight.")},"team-inspector":{about:"The selected stage (its row, Run, the gate card), block (holders, changes) or member.",help:$p("Click a stage, a block or a member on the board; with nothing selected the stage at a gate shows first.","Run starts that stage; a problem in the file or a blocking preflight finding is listed right here, with Run anyway for the preflight.","At a gate: Accept marks it done and starts the stages after it, Redo runs it again with your instruction, Stop ends the run.","A block lists who holds which part until when, and every change line (More pages back).","A member's lineup opens in Roles.")},"team-feed":{about:"Every move of the run, newest last: states, triggers, gates, claims and changes.",help:$p("Each line: the time since the run started, its kind, the stage, what happened.","The chips hide or show a kind; report and note lines always show.","Click a line to select its stage; at the bottom the list follows the live run.")}},_r=(...e)=>e.join(`
